  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GCRF/PaCCS: Inter-disciplinary Innovation Awards on Conflict and International Development - Living on the Margins: Using literary comics to understand the role of borderland brokers in post-war transitions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project uses literary comic strips to promote understanding of the role of borderland brokers mediating political relations and shaping post-war transitions in Nepal and Sri Lanka. Benefits policymakers, local groups, researchers. SDGs:10,16</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Challenges Research Fund (GCRF) supports cutting-edge research to address challenges faced by developing countries. The fund addresses the UN sustainable development goals. It aims to maximise the impact of research and innovation to improve lives and opportunity in the developing world.</narrative>
  </description>
